# The hand-authored landing pages (index.html, <category>/index.html, 404.html)
# and the source assets/ (CSS, JS, logo) ARE committed; everything else under
# site/ is built fresh on each push (CI workflow runs tools/build_site.py and
# uploads the resulting site/ as a Pages artifact).

